    "Content": "<p>Read-write premium caching is now available for Azure HPC Cache.&nbsp; Read-write premium caching (also known as premium SKU), provides:&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>Lower latency&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>Increased disk throughput&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n\t<li>\r\n\t<p>Increased network bandwidth&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://aka.ms/premium-hpc-cache\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Read-write premium caching is now available for Azure HPC Cache. Read-write premium caching (also known as premium SKU), provides:\n\nLower latency\n\nIncreased disk throughput\n\nIncreased network bandwidth\n\nLearn more ."
